225→    // Resume fallback: try with resume first. If the SDK yields a "result"
226→    // message with "No conversation found" (container was recreated and lost
227→    // the session), suppress that error and retry without resume, prepending
228→    // conversation history so the model has context.
229→    let currentPrompt = body.message;
